title: "ftp-deploy-mcp"
abstract: >-
  Model Context Protocol server to deploy, inspect and transfer files over FTP,
  FTPS and SFTP from AI coding agents, with local-root confinement, SFTP host-key
  pinning, SHA-256-verified staged promotion, human confirmation and rollback.
